.TH FERDIM-NM 1 "2026-10-21" "ferdim 1.3.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ferdim-nm \- FerDim native messaging host for Firefox
.SH DESCRIPTION
Internal bridge between the FerDim Firefox extension and the
.BR ferdim (1)
daemon. Firefox launches it automatically per the manifest installed at
/usr/share/mozilla/native-messaging-hosts/ferdim.json; it is not meant to be
run by hand. Starts the daemon on demand if it is not running.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ferdim (1)
